  "summary": "The identified studies apply boosted decision-tree ensembles to the task of predicting road traffic flow. Gupta et al. (2023) [V0231] report an accuracy of 0.85 using the AgriSat-4 dataset, while Fischer et al. (2022) [V0230] achieve an F1 score of 0.78 on the Atlas-ICU dataset. Haddad et al. (2024) [V0232] document a deployment study on LedgerGuard with a Mean Absolute Error (MAE) of 0.92, and El-Sayed et al. (2021) [V0229] report an AUROC of 0.71 on MetroFlow. Additionally, Gupta et al. (2023) [V0208] apply the method to predicting customer attrition, achieving 0.75 accuracy on AgriSat-4.",
